+## Controlled upper-band comparison
+
+Reproduce from the repository root with the CUDA-enabled project environment:
+
+```powershell
+./venv/Scripts/python.exe tests/audit_r3_product.py upper-band --output docs/validation/r3_upper_band
+./venv/Scripts/python.exe -m pytest tests/test_r3_fine_product.py tests/test_diagnostics.py tests/test_r5_spectral_eta.py -q --basetemp=runs/r3-upper-band-pytest-20260918
